WEBVTT

00:03:26.666 --> 00:03:30.423
Rondik psîkolojiya îrîsê

00:03:30.423 --> 00:03:32.429
aram dikin.

00:03:33.023 --> 00:03:35.700
Ji bo pîvazê ez xemgîn im İris.

00:03:35.703 --> 00:03:37.085
Lê meraq neke,

00:03:37.085 --> 00:03:40.680
heta ku rondikên te ye parezker hebin

00:03:40.603 --> 00:03:41.828
tu ê baş bî.

00:03:42.028 --> 00:03:43.076
Bawer bike.